    {
      "id": "56774bf7a0ef840676a1540afe222280ef1a28f07541551f8ea1df1bebab7cae",
      "text": "9 Ways AI Coding Has Rewired My Brain",
      "hash": "4ca6b86a61a59212b2818f7fd2edd2acbd0a438bb45c5bfbc73a2152074c0663"
    },
    {
      "id": "4ca660bb724287e957b43b602080320e7b1c80fe686a03b568759d902376bd13",
      "text": "Discover 9 ways AI-assisted coding rewires your development mindset: integration testing, architecture, modules, and strategies for managing cognitive load.",
